    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9a54a0b0a733a08528ebb38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。要看放声在这个夏天的成长状况。\n她也有可能在成长后\n变得不适合称霸三赛距不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc3ab24ca8583e2e57463631574ba810767997fa9ebb1f85dc5ec327fa341d46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
