    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385f457779ce66024eef04ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果肌肉量增加让身体变得太重，\n或是迟迟无法提升耐力，就很难跑中距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e986b264972eeda19a43d20325f407b96261d4d1bdd2d8697c643347776a116",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccdac59146984c1534d82f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要适应中距离，将会增加感觉失常的风险……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e83610778d15614bf5761fe79a8b5b170efc70ab89f7ae469e6031400969120f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
