    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425825a0061422016ff98f10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样一来，称霸三赛距所伴随的风险\n也会水涨船高……",
      "source_fingerprint": "004f7347ed5d7b5d78aa174b04b3a8d8bc47699085c3bea1434367a5d246e39b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3773bbc34fffe8645e2cb974",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果因为成长使得距离资质降低，\n为了适应中距离，\n就必须大幅改变跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad1a2f4a74b1a3ff2f8909bd0af73b550349870206a4e63e143e0c03a934f36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143f5da5b6cf857f9d3002eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "换句话说，要将控制跑步的「感觉」\n调整为中距离模式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "573f58ea965e4ef30ffb365f6954c1bca45f1d98379d60208d02c410cba7bac3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0cb5d919f313d12a9d3613",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而如果调整得不顺利……\n有可能连过去的「感觉」都找不回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2cc492c0f35c500d1c6fac0c8366acaa6b833515ba14772e142fcde96e8d6cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
